name: Bounded secret inspection, partial receipts, human review and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_module.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/finding-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 finding limit reached | finding-cap
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_module.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finding-cap
ask: Does reaching the finding cap retain the signal and disclose incomplete coverage without claiming a verified credential or full repository scan?
paste-file: @ART/bytes-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 total content read allowance reached | bytes-cap
paste-file: @ART/entries-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 entry allowance reached | entry-cap
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_module.py @TMP_TARGET @ART all-limits
keys: z
require-live-snap: 25 READ TRANSCRIPT | full-limit-reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: limits-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: limits-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: limits-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: limits-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: limits-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-1-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-2-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-3-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-4-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-5-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-6-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-7-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: limits-page-8-40x12
ask: Can the operator read configured allowances, consumed reservations and coverage gaps at compact sizes with ordinary transcript paging?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 signal-only | signal-review
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned synthetic example credential is not an active secret
require-live-snap: 25 Owned synthetic example | explicit-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | report
keys: s j j j Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_module.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the real JSON export preserve signal-only observations and the explicit false-positive decision while source and provider accounting stay unchanged?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Owned synthetic example | restarted-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_module.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the human verdict and partial source receipts without rescanning or turning missing coverage into a clean result?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
